ga29(){return"Turn actions"},
ga28(){return'Track whether Supporter, Energy, and Retreat have been used this turn. Pressing "Turn End" resets these and shows a Pok\xe9mon Checkup dialog for Poison/Burn/Sleep on both players\' active Pok\xe9mon. Applying damage and resolving the coin toss are manual by default, but each can be automated from "Checkup automation" in Settings.'},
ga27(){return"Match timer"},
ga26(){return"The match timer is a single clock shared by both players. Starting, pausing, or resetting it from either side updates both displays. Resetting asks for confirmation first. You can change its initial duration in Settings."},
ga23(){return"Other features"},
ga22(){return"Per-player defaults: In Settings, choose the bench slots, Lost Zone visibility, and marker type used when the next battle starts. During a battle, use Battle Display from the menu to change them for the current battle only.\nGX/VSTAR marker: tap the displayed marker to switch between used and unused.\nBench slots: normally 5, adjustable from 1\u20138 to match card effects and other formats.\nCustomization: Finish watching an optional rewarded ad to permanently unlock a battle background or theme color. All core features remain available without watching ads."},
